    <title>COSENTINO | LinkedIn</title>
    <meta name="description" content="COSENTINO | 237,317 followers on LinkedIn. Meaningful Design to Inspire People´s Lives
 | The Cosentino Group is a global and Spanish company that produces and distributes high value innovative surfaces for architecture and design. With presence in more than 80 countries, its pioneering brands Silestone, Dekton and Sensa, make it being a company leader in the sector, that imagines and anticipates, together with its customers and partners, design solutions that offer value and inspiration to people’ lives.
Follow our Linkedin page and get to know better a company that gives an important value to the people that integrate it.">

