    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"COSENTINO","url":"https://es.linkedin.com/company/cosentino"},"datePublished":"2026-08-14T10:30:58.820Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7493977464264699905-NQFK","text":"📍 Torremolinos, Málaga (Spain)\nDekton Kovik is combined on worktops and claddings with Dekton Argentium, a grey with a trowelled effect reminiscent of lime stuccoes. It is also present in the reception area, where it accompanies Dekton Somnia on the floor and cladding, as well as the striking Sensa Maori.\n\nVARBA Arquitectura praises the variety of solutions available from the company, which has allowed them to choose both Dekton and Sensa in different colours. This, in their words, has facilitated coherence between the various elements of the project.\n\nDiscover more about this project at https://lnkd.in/ehjiMNh4\n\n#CosentinoProject \n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7493977464264699905-NQFK"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"COSENTINO","url":"https://es.linkedin.com/company/cosentino"},"datePublished":"2026-08-11T10:47:06.196Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7492894358145335296--9B5","text":"📍 Santa Eulalia, Ibiza (Spain)\nIn this project in Ibiza, Dekton Marmorio brings the essence of Mediterranean architecture to the bathroom: light, calm, and timeless materials.\n\nInspired by Travertino Navona, its delicate veining adds depth and movement without detracting from the overall serenity. This choice creates continuity between surfaces and makes every element—from the wall cladding to the sink—part of a single composition.\n\nA space designed to pause, breathe, and enjoy.\n\nDekton Marmorio. The beauty of stone, reinterpreted for everyday living.\nDiscover more at https://lnkd.in/eSYMZusH\n\n#CosentinoProject ","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7492894358145335296--9B5"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"COSENTINO","url":"https://es.linkedin.com/company/cosentino"},"datePublished":"2026-08-10T09:20:43.442Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7492510232221470720-W1h-","text":"📍 Burbank, California (USA)\nDesigned by Sevada Yedgarian of S.Y. Designers, this contemporary residence showcases how a unified surface strategy shapes the aesthetic and functional performance of a home. Throughout the project, multiple Dekton colors were used across key architectural elements, creating continuity and supporting the design’s balance of bold materials and softened forms.\n\nDekton was specified across flooring, countertops, wall cladding, and custom features, allowing the designer to maintain a consistent material language throughout the interior. \n\nDiscover more about this cohesive contemporary home at \nhttps://lnkd.in/emeWrvNn\n\n#CosentinoProject \n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7492510232221470720-W1h-"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"COSENTINO","url":"https://es.linkedin.com/company/cosentino"},"datePublished":"2026-08-07T10:38:24.952Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7491442620385120256-zGSO","text":"📍 Burbank, California (USA)\nEvery inch of this luxury Burbank residence was meticulously crafted into a true work of art. The full expression of Nina Avetisova’s creative vision, Via La Paz, also stands out as one of the designer’s most meaningful and personal career achievements. Aesthetics coupled with sustainability and durability made Dekton and Silestone the ideal choice for a project of this scale, ensuring long-lasting beauty and performance.\n\nDIscover more about this project at https://lnkd.in/ed4jjS5k\n\n#CosentinoProject \n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7491442620385120256-zGSO"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"COSENTINO","url":"https://es.linkedin.com/company/cosentino"},"datePublished":"2026-08-06T14:11:22.012Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentino-dekton-dektonlunar-activity-7491133823402004480-i9dQ","text":"📍 Melbourne (Australia)\nAn iconic building in Melbourne's financial district begins a new chapter with Dekton Lunar. For the renovation of the Argus Centre, the design team selected Dekton Lunar to create a contemporary ventilated façade that enhances the building's architectural identity while delivering the high performance required for demanding urban environments.\n\nWith its refined concrete-inspired aesthetic, dimensional stability, UV resistance and long-term durability, Dekton Lunar provides a façade solution designed to stand the test of time, respecting the past while shaping the future of the city.\n\nhttps://lnkd.in/ekS6vM7Y\n\nArchitecture & Design: GRAY PUKSAND + BG&E\n#Cosentino #Dekton #DektonLunar #Architecture #FacadeDesign #CommercialArchitecture #UrbanDesign #Melbourne #SustainableDesign\n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentino-dekton-dektonlunar-activity-7491133823402004480-i9dQ"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"COSENTINO","url":"https://es.linkedin.com/company/cosentino"},"datePublished":"2026-07-31T11:57:07.307Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7488925712306057216-oz73","text":"📍Calgary, Alberta (Canada)\nWhen a home becomes a reflection of its inhabitants, every material takes on new meaning.\n\nIn the renovation of his own home in Calgary, designer Alykhan Velji chose Dekton Khalo to shape spaces where elegance, functionality, and personality coexist in perfect balance. A timeless palette of materials, high-performance surfaces, and meticulous attention to detail make this home an authentic expression of his design vision.\n\nA project that demonstrates that the best interiors aren’t just meant to be admired—they’re meant to be lived in. https://lnkd.in/exCbfm5W\n\n#CosentinoProject","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7488925712306057216-oz73"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"COSENTINO","url":"https://es.linkedin.com/company/cosentino"},"datePublished":"2026-07-28T13:00:05.035Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7487854393686605828-FuLg","text":"📍 Calvia, Mallorca (Spain)\nDesigned to let you experience the Mediterranean to the fullest, this home makes material continuity the central theme of its architecture. With Dekton Albarium as the sole material, its presence extends from the floors to the pool, the bathrooms, and the wall cladding, creating a seamless connection between the interior and exterior.\n\nDiscover the full project at the following link: https://lnkd.in/duM9P7Bj\n\n#CosentinoProject","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7487854393686605828-FuLg"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"COSENTINO","url":"https://es.linkedin.com/company/cosentino"},"datePublished":"2026-07-27T13:14:02.495Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7487495518336577538-hW6Z","text":"📍London (United Kingdom)\nIn the heart of London’s financial district, the renovation of Marlow House demonstrates how contemporary design can harmonize with the architectural legacy of a historic building.\n\nGravity Design Associates chose Dekton Sabbia, from the Pietra Kode collection, to clad various common areas of the complex, providing a serene and timeless aesthetic along with the durability required for high-traffic spaces. The result is an environment where functionality, durability, and design coexist seamlessly.\n\nLearn more about this project and how Dekton is helping to transform the workspaces of the future https://lnkd.in/dufDADWY\n\n#CosentinoProject","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7487495518336577538-hW6Z"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"COSENTINO","url":"https://es.linkedin.com/company/cosentino"},"datePublished":"2026-07-24T11:56:44.031Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7486388899645366272-zDtm","text":"📍Israel\nMichael Ohayon’s vision comes to life through a space where design, functionality, and materiality exist in perfect harmony.\n\nIn this luxury apartment in Israel, every detail has been carefully considered to create a sophisticated and timeless atmosphere. The beauty and performance of Dekton Laos and Sensa Black Beauty enhance a design where surfaces become the true protagonists of the space.\n\nA project that showcases how materials can transform a creative vision into a unique experience. https://lnkd.in/eyXN5tyt\n\n#CosentinoProject ","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7486388899645366272-zDtm"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"COSENTINO","url":"https://es.linkedin.com/company/cosentino"},"datePublished":"2026-07-24T11:19:43.490Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7486379585992015873-2OKL","text":"📍New Zealand\nIn this project, architecture and landscape interact seamlessly to create a space where the interior and exterior blend into a single experience.\n\nThe outdoor kitchen, conceived as an extension of the home, finds the perfect balance between design and performance in Dekton Opera and Dekton Zenith. Their surfaces provide visual continuity, durability in the most demanding conditions, and a timeless aesthetic that enhances the connection with nature.\n\nA project by Three-sixty Architecture, Georgia Langridge, and Modi Design, where every detail demonstrates that outdoor spaces can also become the heart of the home https://lnkd.in/ehpGsFPM\n\n#CosentinoProject ","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cosentino_cosentinoproject-activity-7486379585992015873-2OKL"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"COSENTINO","url":"https://es.linkedin.com/company/cosentino","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Ctra A 334, km. 59","addressLocality":"Cantoria","addressRegion":"Almería","postalCode":"04850","addressCountry":"ES"},"description":"The Cosentino Group is a global and Spanish company that produces and distributes high value innovative surfaces for architecture and design. With presence in more than 80 countries, its pioneering brands Silestone, Dekton and Sensa, make it being a company leader in the sector, that imagines and anticipates, together with its customers and partners, design solutions that offer value and inspiration to people’ lives.\nFollow our Linkedin page and get to know better a company that gives an important value to the people that integrate it.\n\nMeaningful Design to Inspire People´s lives\n\n\n","numberOfEmployees":{"value":3917,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQEA9hggdVN_HA/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1657187123767/cosentino_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=D_W1klcmkvsiVIhPUD3ac060Ahz68x7WBgqfNwUdlpU","description":"COSENTINO","@type":"ImageObject"},"slogan":"Meaningful Design to Inspire People´s Lives\n","sameAs":"https://www.cosentino.com/"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
