    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">📍 Burbank, California (USA)
Designed by <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sevada-yedgarian-a8575a214?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sevada Yedgarian</a> of S.Y. Designers, this contemporary residence showcases how a unified surface strategy shapes the aesthetic and functional performance of a home. Throughout the project, multiple Dekton colors were used across key architectural elements, creating continuity and supporting the design’s balance of bold materials and softened forms.

Dekton was specified across flooring, countertops, wall cladding, and custom features, allowing the designer to maintain a consistent material language throughout the interior. 

Discover more about this cohesive contemporary home at 
<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/emeWrvNn?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/emeWrvNn</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcosentinoproject&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CosentinoProject</a> 
</p>
