    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">📍 Burbank, California (USA)
Every inch of this luxury Burbank residence was meticulously crafted into a true work of art. The full expression of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nina-avetisova-134ba9235?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Nina Avetisova</a>’s creative vision, Via La Paz, also stands out as one of the designer’s most meaningful and personal career achievements. Aesthetics coupled with sustainability and durability made Dekton and Silestone the ideal choice for a project of this scale, ensuring long-lasting beauty and performance.

DIscover more about this project at <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/ed4jjS5k?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/ed4jjS5k</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcosentinoproject&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CosentinoProject</a> 
</p>
