    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">📍Calgary, Alberta (Canada)
When a home becomes a reflection of its inhabitants, every material takes on new meaning.

In the renovation of his own home in Calgary, designer Alykhan Velji chose Dekton Khalo to shape spaces where elegance, functionality, and personality coexist in perfect balance. A timeless palette of materials, high-performance surfaces, and meticulous attention to detail make this home an authentic expression of his design vision.

A project that demonstrates that the best interiors aren’t just meant to be admired—they’re meant to be lived in. <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/exCbfm5W?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/exCbfm5W</a>

