  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">📍London (United Kingdom)
In the heart of London’s financial district, the renovation of Marlow House demonstrates how contemporary design can harmonize with the architectural legacy of a historic building.

Gravity Design Associates chose Dekton Sabbia, from the Pietra Kode collection, to clad various common areas of the complex, providing a serene and timeless aesthetic along with the durability required for high-traffic spaces. The result is an environment where functionality, durability, and design coexist seamlessly.

Learn more about this project and how Dekton is helping to transform the workspaces of the future <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dufDADWY?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dufDADWY</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcosentinoproject&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CosentinoProject</a></p>
