    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">📍Israel
Michael Ohayon’s vision comes to life through a space where design, functionality, and materiality exist in perfect harmony.

In this luxury apartment in Israel, every detail has been carefully considered to create a sophisticated and timeless atmosphere. The beauty and performance of Dekton Laos and Sensa Black Beauty enhance a design where surfaces become the true protagonists of the space.

A project that showcases how materials can transform a creative vision into a unique experience. <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eyXN5tyt?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eyXN5tyt</a>

