  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">📍New Zealand
In this project, architecture and landscape interact seamlessly to create a space where the interior and exterior blend into a single experience.

The outdoor kitchen, conceived as an extension of the home, finds the perfect balance between design and performance in Dekton Opera and Dekton Zenith. Their surfaces provide visual continuity, durability in the most demanding conditions, and a timeless aesthetic that enhances the connection with nature.

A project by Three-sixty Architecture, Georgia Langridge, and Modi Design, where every detail demonstrates that outdoor spaces can also become the heart of the home <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/ehpGsFPM?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/ehpGsFPM</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcosentinoproject&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CosentinoProject</a> </p>
